WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.654
-You know, here at "Late Night"
every night,

00:00:01.654 --> 00:00:03.937
I deliver a monologue
composed --

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:07.373
[ Laughter ]

00:00:07.373 --> 00:00:08.641
You know, because it's like

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:10.710
after six years, we [bleep]

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.012
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:17.250
Composed of jokes written
by a diverse team of waiters.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.317
Guys.

00:00:18.317 --> 00:00:22.655
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:25.358
As a result, a lot of jokes come
across my desk that,

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.026
due to my being
a straight white male,

00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:28.461
it would be difficult
for me to deliver,

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.797
but we don't think that should
stop you from enjoying them,

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.298
so, we'd like to share them
with you now,

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:34.400
in a segment called
"Jokes Seth Can't Tell."

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.971
♪♪

00:00:38.971 --> 00:00:41.107
These are two of our writers.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.442
That's Amber and Jenny.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:43.442
-I'm Black.

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:44.643
-And I'm gay!

00:00:44.643 --> 00:00:46.379
-And we're both women.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.514
-And I'm not.
So, how this works is

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:50.349
I'll read the setups
to these jokes

00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:52.585
and Amber and Jenny
will read the punch lines.

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.820
Here we go.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:56.088
After an absence of 13 years,

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:58.858
softball will return
to the Summer Olympics.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.262
-So, finally, all my exes
will be in one place.

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:04.597
-Warner Bros. recently announced
that they're looking

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:08.567
for a Black director to helm the
upcoming Black Superman movie.

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:10.903
-Black Superman
is like white Superman,

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:14.607
except he also has
two other jobs.

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.343
-The state of Maine recently
started offering incentives

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.479
to encourage residents
to get vaccinated,

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:21.580
like gift cards to L.L.Bean.

00:01:21.580 --> 00:01:22.848
-Said lesbians,

00:01:22.848 --> 00:01:25.084
"Anh, I don't need
any formalwear."

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:28.454
-If lesbians buy formal
clothes at L.L.Bean,

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:30.222
where do they buy
casual clothes?

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:31.891
-At L.L.Bean Outlet.

00:01:31.891 --> 00:01:33.192
-Ah.

00:01:33.192 --> 00:01:36.028
"Essence" magazine
recently published a list

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:39.064
of the best skin care products
for Black skin.

00:01:39.064 --> 00:01:41.434
-You can tell a good
Black beauty product

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.669
when it's locked
behind the glass.

00:01:43.669 --> 00:01:45.137
-Huh, so that really happens?

00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:48.407
-Yeah. And it's a shame because,
by the time they come help you,

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:49.976
your hair's already dried out.

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:52.212
-Wow!
How fast does it dry out?

00:01:52.212 --> 00:01:54.514
-Faster than Jenny moves in
with someone.

00:01:54.514 --> 00:01:55.948
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.948 --> 00:01:58.918
-New York's oldest lesbian bar,
Henrietta Hudson,

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.154
is undergoing
an extensive renovation.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.522
-Instead of a pool table,
it will now have a bigger,

00:02:03.522 --> 00:02:04.724
nicer pool table.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:07.827
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.530
-Bon Appétit magazine recently
published an article titled,

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:14.833
"It's Time to Give
Black Barbecue Culture
the Attention It Deserves."

00:02:14.833 --> 00:02:18.404
-"Black barbecues deserves
attention, alright,"

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.139
said a white lady
calling the police.

00:02:20.139 --> 00:02:22.375
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:25.111
-Some parents in Ohio were angry
after a lesbian couple

00:02:25.111 --> 00:02:27.713
were voted prom king and queen
at a local high school.

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:29.148
-Wow, wait 'til they find out

00:02:29.148 --> 00:02:31.384
about the whole cast
of the school play.

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.352
-Hey, Jenny,
when you were young,

00:02:33.352 --> 00:02:35.521
what was your favorite
afterschool activity?

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:37.223
-Daydreaming
about Debbie Gibson.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:39.859
-Huh. And was she popular
with young lesbians?

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:43.229
-I mean, she did wear
a pork pie hat.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:44.964
[ Laughter ]
-That, she did.

00:02:44.964 --> 00:02:46.432
Producers have announced

00:02:46.432 --> 00:02:48.468
that former Food Network star
Paula Deen

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:51.704
will become a judge on the
upcoming season of "MasterChef."

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:56.042
-Fulfilling Deen's lifelong
dream of being called "Master."

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.110
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.545
-Former "Bachelor" star
Colton Underwood

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:01.914
announced, in a recent
interview, that he is gay.

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:04.417
-"Yeah, that's what
'bachelor' means,"

00:03:04.417 --> 00:03:05.852
said your grandparents.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:07.920
-Did your grandparents have
a favorite bachelor?

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.088
-Mm-hmm, Liberace.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:10.689
-Oh, mine, too.
-Hey, Seth,

00:03:10.689 --> 00:03:13.659
why don't you tell one?
-No. I don't think I should.

00:03:13.659 --> 00:03:16.095
-Oh, come on, just one!
-Guys, I just don't think

00:03:16.095 --> 00:03:17.196
it'll end well.
-Do it!

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:19.599
-Okay, but only
because I trust you both,

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:21.501
especially after this
difficult year.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:24.270
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.173
A student newspaper in Buffalo
recently published an article

00:03:27.173 --> 00:03:28.908
titled "Am I Dressed
Like a Lesbian?"

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:32.144
Well, if you put that much
thought into how you're dressed,

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:33.913
then, no, you're probably not.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:35.614
-[ Gasp ]
-Seth!

00:03:35.614 --> 00:03:36.749
-How dare you!

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:38.884
-You told me it would be okay!

00:03:38.884 --> 00:03:41.087
-You should be ashamed
of yourself!

00:03:41.087 --> 00:03:44.256
-Argh! Black women
and lesbians are liars!

00:03:44.256 --> 00:03:47.427
♪♪

